<!DOCTYPE html><html><body>
<h2>You Still Have an Active Rental</h2>
<p>Hi <%= @member.firstname %>,</p>
<p><%= @reason_text.capitalize %>, but you still have an active rental:</p>
<ul>
  <% @spaces.each do |space| %>
    <li><strong><%= space %></strong></li>
  <% end %>
</ul>
<p>A rental stays active, and keeps billing, until you cancel it.<% if @can_renew %> If you would rather keep it, renew your membership first.<% end %></p>
<p>To end it, <a href="<%= @profile_url %>">open your profile in the Member Portal</a>, go to the <strong>Rentals</strong> tab, and choose <strong>Cancel Rental</strong>. A board member confirms the space is empty before it can be rented again.</p>
<p><a href="<%= @help_url %>">Step-by-step help: End a rental</a></p>
<p>If you have any questions please contact us at contact@manchestermakerspace.org.</p>
<p>— Manchester Makerspace</p>
</body></html>
